From 9f98d785a46ec9e9a8df19e89eab97d7ddeae140 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Canonical endpoint audit <audit@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:45:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: authenticate fee-backed expiry in canonical coin
 records

Fold into native C17a expiry owner 140. Commit fee share and effective expiry in versioned coin provenance; preserve explicit expiry semantics through sparse proofs, shard and undo transport, snapshots, and durable reopen. Reject redundant undo fees that disagree with authenticated records. Use fresh development storage formats V5-V8 and reject prior homes without migration. Add paid/explicit lifetime, proof mutation, all decoder, reopen, and old-schema regression coverage. eCash behavior is unchanged.
---
